cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "NeoPhylo: Learn how phylogenetic trees are built — step by step, in your browser"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based teaching tool for distance-based phylogenetics. Step through
  Neighbor-Joining and UPGMA one join at a time, simulate sequence evolution on
  a true tree, and compare the inferred tree to the truth — with guided lessons
  and a sandbox for your own data.
version: 1.0.0
authors:
